# apps/supervisor (AD-21, Story 28.3): the nested project's own ignore entries,
# mirrored from apps/supervisor/.gitignore (which stays; git honours both).
# Its slash-less patterns match at any depth there, hence **/ here.
apps/supervisor/.tk-studio/config.local.yaml
apps/supervisor/**/node_modules/
apps/supervisor/**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/supervisor/**/.env
apps/supervisor/**/.env.*
apps/supervisor/.bmad-loop/runs/
apps/supervisor/.bmad-loop/cache/
apps/supervisor/.bmad-loop/policy.toml
apps/supervisor/.bmad-loop/routing.current.json
apps/supervisor/_bmad/render/
apps/supervisor/_bmad/config.user.yaml
apps/supervisor/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/supervision/
apps/supervisor/.bmad-loop/archive/
# apps/studio-web (Story 30.1): the nested project's own ignore entries, mirrored from
# apps/studio-web/.gitignore (which stays; git honours both), plus its build output.
